{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1509.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"601f17612feac622d22cf0f1ee54b444c95aae1335fe1bd9abeed58138fc4699","ja":"思い切って話してみたら、\n気持ちは伝わるんだね。","zh":"鼓起勇气说出来后，\n心意真的能传达给对方呢。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1509.unity3d","item_key":"commands[27].text","source_sha256":"ba796056d86b4cc8b82bf2bbde8c7d60d0e5b1957eb846de9488d10230f7d71f","ja":"私も、思い切って、お話ししてみようかな～。\n他の出演者の人とも、お話ししてみたいし。","zh":"我也鼓起勇气去跟人聊聊看吧～。\n而且我也想和其他演出人员说说话。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
