{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1509.unity3d","item_key":"commands[37].text","source_sha256":"b402bd9dcb8547f9943fc705ca6ae5f419b2eb8c811af806ecdf6d143f15de4a","ja":"ふふ、頼ってくださって、嬉しいです！\n何かあれば、いつでもお声がけください♪","zh":"呵呵，您能依赖我，我很开心！\n有什么事的话，请随时叫我哦♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1509.unity3d","item_key":"commands[38].text","source_sha256":"8d2ac296112956d5e777738aaa53ff1325db72edf41aaf535b54c91dc13707f1","ja":"それでは、他の共演者の方にも、\nご挨拶に参りましょう。","zh":"那么，我们也去向\n其他共演者打个招呼吧。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
